      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arlee%2C_Montana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Arlee sits in the shadow of the Mission Mountains and serves as a trading center for residents of the Flathead Indian Reservation.",
